DESCRIPTION:New in your area\nhttps://luma.com/qjw9i5a9\n\nNathan Fielder 
 made a documentary about Elizabeth Holmes\, we got a bunch of tickets to 
 watch it with you. Join us at AMC Kabuki 8 to watch You Can See Everythin
 g. Fielder and Lance Oppenheim started filming Holmes 34 days before she 
 went to prison. Three years later\, they’ve made what looks like a very
  strange trip through one of Silicon Valley’s wildest stories. Saturday
 \, October 17 · 6:00 PM · A
